  "notes": [
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-app-package-info-update-0000002236201250#section41694086",
      "text": "APP软件包上传完成后，通过该接口刷新HarmonyOS应用/元服务的软件包信息。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-app-package-info-update-0000002236201250#section41694086",
      "text": "该接口支持解析软件包中的构建版本号（buildVersion），用于区分同一主版本下的不同测试子版本。解析完成后，可以从查询应用软件包信息接口返回的packageInfo参数中获取buildVersion字段。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-app-package-info-update-0000002236201250#section41694086",
      "text": "接口调用者的角色：账号持有者、管理员、APP管理员、运营。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-app-package-info-update-0000002236201250#section119494174419",
      "text": "本接口支持使用Service Account方式和API客户端方式，二者区别请参见获取服务端授权。"
    },
    {
